Dictionary data
===============

The selected source entries in `source/`, the translations in `translations/`
and the dictionary built from them (wiktionary-en-ko.zip) are derived from
English Wiktionary and are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

English Wiktionary (https://en.wiktionary.org/) is written by its contributors.
The machine-readable data comes from Wiktextract (https://kaikki.org/):
Tatu Ylonen, "Wiktextract: Wiktionary as Machine-Readable Structured Data",
Proceedings of LREC 2022, pp. 1317-1325.
